onération d'impôt sur vos revenus locatifs. Le bail commercial avec le gestionnaire professionnel assure le versement des loyers dès l'acquisition, que le logement soit occupé ou non.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine.\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"4 Place de la Mairie","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjI1ZTY1NmRhNjFhNDMxZDY2MTliNTZhNTRjYTM2ZmQ5OWY4YTI0ZGUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkOWMxNGE1MTdhZmNiMzQ1N2YwODhiZDliY2Y5YTMyMiJ9?signature=d89423cfc44cd27f0d90ca05bd30ffc5cd2800d79bfe033cbd4d0c1b5926be47","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImM3NmZhYzUzNGNhOWQxNWY5NDFmODExNjVhYmFmYTFkMDE0Mjg3YzkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI0MzI1ZWI4MDU2N2I5ZjkzODIwMjA2YzllMjkyNDQ1YSJ9?signature=d1408aecc7c98a8065953427ac186de03096a5c70dc8a34c6c53bfb278897fae","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjVlOTE4YjNhMzUwNDkwMGQ1YWRkNWUyZGQ2OTI3MGM0NjMxZTZiOTQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5NzQ4ZDBkZjk5YWM0NTU4OTUzNDE5M2NiMjBkOWVkMiJ9?signature=ae60f8c0d407b6b68d6076fdc840a5ec477af57272039511097e9982418e2109","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImI5NmExMWY3MzA5NTBiN2RlODE2OGU1YTkwNWNhYjFkZWRmOWI1NjciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3NWYyYmM0NWFkMDdlNjUxZWIzMjUyMzE0MjQ1YThjNCJ9?signature=bcc825fd1f55be5b1ce70df7025bd66c301748c6d80385bb180b6f62358d9140","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijk5ODc3NDkyY2RkYTc1ZWYxMGExYzZhZjBkNTg3NGM5YTZkNj